# aliases: led_royal_blue royalblue-led
# Royal-blue InGaN LED. Single narrow emission band (no phosphor), the pump
# colour used inside white LEDs. Peak ~450 nm. Measured single-die SPD
# (Brendel 2021).
# CIE 1931 xy=(0.153,0.026). See data/light/measured/led-royal-blue.csv for source.
spd file:data/light/measured/led-royal-blue.csv
